  "text": "Let's Remember. Weather is the daily atmospheric condition of a place. Climate is the average weather over a long period. Latitude, altitude, distance from the sea, and winds influence climate. The world has different types of climate, including tropical, desert, and tundra. The Earth has three climatic zones: torrid, temperate, and frigid.",
